# ============================================================================
# Graphify ignore file
# ============================================================================
# One pattern per line. Lines starting with '#' are blank/comment lines and
# are skipped. Patterns are glob (fnmatch) style and are matched against:
#   - the file/folder NAME
#   - every path segment (so a bare token matches that name anywhere)
#   - the whole path relative to this project, and any prefix of it
#
# NOTE: These are already excluded by the Graphify engine built-ins and do NOT
# need to be listed here:
#   node_modules, .git, venv/.venv, env/.env, __pycache__, dist, build,
#   target, out, site-packages, lib64, lock files (package-lock.json, etc.),
#   hidden files/folders (starting with '.')
# ============================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled / generated build output - never part of the source architecture
# (.NET emits obj/ and bin/ at each project root; artifacts/ holds built *.dll,
#  *.pdb, *.exe and extracted *.deps.json payloads)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
artifacts/
bin/
obj/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Packaging / metadata markers that add no structure to the architecture graph
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
package.json
package-lock.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL - uncomment any of these to exclude them too
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# docs/                          # design/spec markdown (kept by default)
# skills/                        # agent skill docs
# prompts/                       # prompt engineering assets
# .github/     
# .vscode/                 
# graphify-out/
# *.ps1                          # PowerShell dev/test scripts
# README.md
# AGENTS.md
# Memory.md
# KownIssues.md